Z||000000||MooCow||08-19-2001||03:38 PM||||Well I did craig's custom intake and I love it but, I am affraid I am ruining my engine.  The air filter is now open and I know that water can hit it becuase it sits right under the vent.  On start up now my car will smoke some and only does it after it rains or in the morning.  Is it just water being burned or something, cause the smoke is white??  The intake is just like what you can buy from Chris West.  So should I be worried??<P>Thanks Ken<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig_7.jpg"> <BR>87 GT, 3.4 engine with a 4:10 tranny, and Viper Yellow!||||reg||5
