Z||000003||Joe Torma||08-19-2001||05:34 PM||||The smoke is probably the water burning off like you said.  I had hedder wrap on my 3.1 and the thing smoked for like 5 minutes after it rained.  I think it is a bad thing in the long run...I bet the water hitting the exhaust manifold has something to do with cracking them.||||reg||1
